  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow slams into the bony orbit of the eye. It doesn’t quite penetrate into your brain but the eye itself is a total loss! What do you think will look best? A glass eye or an eye patch?</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3). Also, lose the eye – @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.weczkAMPlTjX7lqU]{Amputation (Difficult)}. </p><p>Extraction will be <strong>Easy (+40)</strong> as you cannot possibly do any more damage to the already ruined eye as you yank the shaft out.</p>"
    },
